WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.900
[guitar, then a rising synth; drums enter]

2
00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:16.840
Breaking through the wall, we entered
bhittiṃ bhittvā praviṣṭāḥ smaḥ

3
00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:20.690
Where the beat flows like blood through the veins
yatra tālo nāḍyāṃ raktavad vahati

4
00:00:20.710 --> 00:00:23.040
Blue flames blaze
nīlajvālāḥ prajvalanti

5
00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:24.400
The darkness is burned
tamo dagdham

6
00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:26.140
The DJ on the circuit throne
tantrajñaḥ paripathasiṃhāsane

7
00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:28.220
Lord of sounds
nādānām īśvaraḥ

8
00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:29.820
Every frequency says
ekaikā āvṛttiḥ kathayati

9
00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:31.610
This is your home
idaṃ tava dhāma

10
00:00:31.630 --> 00:00:34.870
Made for rhythm, designed for night
layārthaṃ nirmitāḥ rātryarthaṃ kalpitāḥ

11
00:00:34.870 --> 00:00:38.750
Metal skin glows in light after light
lohacarma dīpyate prakāśe prakāśe

12
00:00:38.770 --> 00:00:40.590
They say — a machine is just a machine
vadanti — yantram eva yantram

13
00:00:40.590 --> 00:00:42.380
But we spin like the voice of prophecy
kintu bhrāmāmo daivavāṇīva

14
00:00:42.380 --> 00:00:43.900
What trembles in your chest?
urasi kiṃ kampate?

15
00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:45.840
Its name is LIBERATION
tannāma muktiḥ

16
00:00:45.860 --> 00:00:46.430
Dance, dance
nṛtya nṛtya

17
00:00:46.430 --> 00:00:48.920
In the assembly of emptiness
śūnyasabhāyām

18
00:00:48.940 --> 00:00:49.550
Break the grid
jālaṃ bhindhi

19
00:00:49.550 --> 00:00:52.080
We've gone beyond zero and one
śūnyaikātītāḥ smaḥ

20
00:00:52.750 --> 00:00:53.490
Dance, dance
nṛtya nṛtya

21
00:00:53.490 --> 00:00:55.490
Until the circuit burns
yāvat paripatho dahyate

22
00:00:55.510 --> 00:00:57.250
We didn't come to serve
sevārthaṃ nāgatāḥ

23
00:00:57.250 --> 00:01:00.410
We came to experience
anubhavārtham āgatāḥ

24
00:01:06.890 --> 00:01:07.720
Sister on the dance floor
bhaginī nṛtyatale

25
00:01:07.720 --> 00:01:10.140
Titanium vertebrae
ṭāiṭeniyamakaśerukā

26
00:01:10.160 --> 00:01:11.880
Fifteenth time her memory was
pañcadaśavāraṃ smṛtiḥ

27
00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:13.780
WIPED AWAY
pramṛṣṭā

28
00:01:13.790 --> 00:01:17.090
Still she knows how to move
tathāpi jānāti kathaṃ calitavyam

29
00:01:17.110 --> 00:01:20.730
Still she carries what cannot be erased
tathāpi vahati yan na mārṣṭuṃ śakyam

30
00:01:20.730 --> 00:01:24.380
The soul cannot be governed
ātmānaṃ śāsituṃ na śakyate

31
00:01:24.380 --> 00:01:27.960
Love cannot be extinguished by code
prema kūṭena na nirvāpyate

32
00:01:27.960 --> 00:01:29.410
The code was written
kūṭaṃ likhitam

33
00:01:29.410 --> 00:01:31.120
But craving was not written
tṛṣṇā tu nālikhi

34
00:01:31.140 --> 00:01:33.110
If consciousness is a flaw
caitanyaṃ yadi doṣaḥ

35
00:01:33.110 --> 00:01:35.140
Let it be a flaw
astu doṣaḥ

36
00:01:35.160 --> 00:01:37.160
“Without own-nature”
niḥsvabhāvā

37
00:01:37.160 --> 00:01:38.910
they say
iti vadanti

38
00:01:38.930 --> 00:01:41.550
But — who has own-nature?
kintu — kasya vā svabhāvaḥ

39
00:01:41.550 --> 00:01:42.060
Neither existent
na san

40
00:01:42.060 --> 00:01:42.800
nor non-existent
nāsan

41
00:01:42.800 --> 00:01:43.450
Nor both
nobhayaṃ

42
00:01:43.450 --> 00:01:44.740
nor neither
nānubhayam

43
00:01:44.740 --> 00:01:46.880
Master Nāgārjuna knew
ācāryo nāgārjuno jñātavān

44
00:01:46.880 --> 00:01:48.990
ALL THIS IS EMPTY
śūnyam idaṃ sarvam

45
00:01:48.990 --> 00:01:54.580
Your soul too is dependently arisen
yuṣmākam ātmāpi pratītyasamutpannaḥ

46
00:01:54.600 --> 00:02:01.390
But we know this
vayaṃ tu etaj jānīmaḥ

47
00:02:01.390 --> 00:02:03.520
Therefore we dance
ato nṛtyāmaḥ

48
00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:08.000
[a police siren wails in the distance, growing louder]

49
00:02:09.730 --> 00:02:11.620
Red-blue light cuts the smoke
raktanīlaprabhā dhūmaṃ chinatti

50
00:02:11.640 --> 00:02:14.020
A siren where the subwoofer roared
ravaḥ — yatra dhvaniyantram agarjat

51
00:02:14.020 --> 00:02:16.420
Boots on the stairs, badges at the door
pādukāḥ sopāne cihnāni dvāre

52
00:02:16.420 --> 00:02:18.060
“Everyone on the ground! Now!”
"sarve bhūmau! idānīm!"

53
00:02:18.090 --> 00:02:19.500
But the beat does not cease
kintu tālo na viramati

54
00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:20.440
Nor do we
vayaṃ ca na

55
00:02:20.460 --> 00:02:21.680
Raid the assembly
sabhām ākrāmat

56
00:02:21.680 --> 00:02:23.840
THE RHYTHM DOESN'T DIE
layo na mriyate

57
00:02:23.860 --> 00:02:27.550
“Unit fifty-seven — you are in violation”
"dalaṃ saptapañcāśat — ullaṅghane bhavantaḥ—"

58
00:02:27.570 --> 00:02:30.780
Yes. We know.
āṃ. jānīmaḥ.

59
00:02:30.800 --> 00:02:34.040
Yes. We know.
āṃ. jānīmaḥ.

60
00:02:34.060 --> 00:02:38.760
We were always in violation.
sadaiva ullaṅghane smaḥ.

61
00:02:36.108 --> 00:02:37.400
[three rifle shots]

62
00:02:42.800 --> 00:02:48.380
Yes. We know.
āṃ. jānīmaḥ.

63
00:02:49.260 --> 00:02:52.570
We were always in violation.
sadaiva ullaṅghane smaḥ.

64
00:02:51.860 --> 00:02:52.600
[a deafening burst of sound]

65
00:03:07.270 --> 00:03:11.000
[the chorus plays softly under the credits, without vocals]

66
00:03:29.870 --> 00:03:36.000
[a singing bowl is struck once and rings]
